notes = "Provisional Violet astral body for all5 actual elemental forms, all artwork/audio UNREVIEWED. Use the supplied15 source clips and120 native facing banks at source fit2, preserving canonical actor scale, source pixels, contacts, origins and clocks. Rest/hurt/death, melee gesture and Breath body are deliberately presented grounded without claiming current canonical ground/air state. Actual walking/flying MovementFacts select Ground_Walk/Fly_Cycle; no sustained flight state, glide, takeoff, landing or aerial melee is inferred. Idle painted-body anchor is a generic measured alpha anchor, never mouth/contact/solid/support. Optional source shadow is off; existing dynamic caster remains. Mouth geometry, breath release/contact and finite breath VFX remain unbound; no supplied normal/depth mask becomes solid. Matching independent-normal program and ordinary publication/native qualification remain required before activation."
